3.iv 
    An expression for Rs can be obtained by manipulating the original
    equation with some algebra
        1. Vout(t) = VcRL / (Rs(t) + RL)
        2. Vout(t) * Rs(t) + Vout(t) * RL = VcRL
        3. Rs(t) = (Vc*RL - Vout(t) * RL) / Vout(T)
        4. Rs(t) = RL(Vc - Vout(T)) / Vout(t)
        5. Rs(t) = 10^4 * (5 - Vout(t)) / Vout(t)
        6. Rs(t) = -10000 + 50000 / Vout(T)

3.v
    Now we use our approximation that Rs~Rinf(C) and re-arrange with 
    algebra
        1. Rs(t) = -10000 + 50000 / Vout(T)
        2. 8.0*10^4*C^(-0.602) = -10000 + 50000 / Vout(T)
        3. C^(-0.602) = (-10000 + (50000 / Vout(T))) / (8.0*10^4)
        4. C^(0.602) = 1 / ((-10000 + (50000 / Vout(T))) / (8.0*10^4))
        5. C(t) = (1 / ((-10000 + (50000 / Vout(T))) / (8.0*10^4))) ^ (1/0.602)
        6. (Rearrange) C(t) = (80000 / (-10000 + 50000 / Vout(t)))^(1/0.602)
        7. C(t) = ( ( 80000 * Vout(t) ) / (-10000 * Vout(t) + 50000))^(1/0.602)